script = ExtResource("1_boss")
id = &"core_intelligence"
display_name = "Core Intelligence"
; Five masks out of one pool, sixty integrity each. Nearly twice Executive Override's 156, and the
; fight is longer than even that says: the first mask refunds three quarters of what it takes until
; four terminals are down, and the fourth discards everything outside its landing window. The
; inherited `phase_two_at`/`phase_three_at` ladder is deliberately absent — see the config script.
